  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guidelines for the business instruments Business Explorer (E1), Business Partnerships (E2), and Innovation Bridge (E4)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the consultancy is to establish the required guidelines and formats for the first calls under the three new business instruments to be launched and implemented in 2026. 
The Objective of the assignment is to have in place the necessary guidelines and formats that will enable the temporary Fund Manager to undertake the first calls and process applications under the three instruments, E1, E2, and E4, in line with the project documents and instrument objectives and ensuring clear, lean and effective application processes.</narrative>
  </description>
